{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25952","headline":"秋怀五首 五 · 鲍溶","name":"秋怀五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙荒变露色，燕鴈南爲客。\n游子声影中，涕零念离析。\n四时如车马，转此今与昔。\n往叹在空中，存事委幽迹。\n翩翩日歛照，朗朗月系夕。\n物生春不留，年壮老还迫。\n天机杳何爲，长寿与松柏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25952.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25952","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}